OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 jobs under threat at
OL,4,Amilitary safety gear factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 jobs are at risk at a
OL,7,FScottish factory which manufactures
OL,8,Fsafety equipment for the military.
OL,10,FGentex has announced proposals to close
OL,11,Fits plant at Stranraer where 111 people
OL,12,Fare employed and to make "changes" at
OL,13,Fits Letchworth site in Hertfordshire.
OL,15,FIt said the move was part of plans to
OL,16,Fcentralise its UK operations in a new
OL,17,Ffacility in Haydock, Merseyside.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
