OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 100 jobs under threat at
OL,4,Amilitary safety gear factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm said no final decision had
OL,7,Fbeen made but eligible employees would
OL,8,Fbe paid until the end of next year -
OL,9,Feven if they are made redundant
OL,10,Fearlier.
